PROPOSED ADDITIONS — Data Health nudges (non-blocking, dismissable):

Add these 3 new Insight types to SmartInsightsCard's computed `insights` array. These appear only when the count > 0. Each is orange (not red — informational, not critical). Each taps through to a filtered item list.

